    "title": "4K Wallpaper & HD Backgrounds",
    "description": "App having large varierties of free hd wallpapers which makes mobile home screen glamorous and unique.\r\n\r\nOver <b>22000+ Wallpapers</b> available in Application\r\n\r\nImages having high quality resilutions so suitable for all size of devices and full display.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2749Features of application</b>\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Live Wallpapers</b>\r\n- Easily set video as background on home and lock screen. Having collection of attractive videos.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>3D Parallax</b>\r\n- Using device motion sensors, App smoothly control 3D depth effect.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Border Edge Lighting Live Wallpaper</b>\r\n- App adding amazing curved rounded multi color corners light on your mobile home and lock screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Auto Wallpaper Changer</b>\r\n- According to user's choice, category selection and app usage, App will automatically change background.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Top Categories</b>\r\n- Based on user's usage, showing top most used categories.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Double wallpapers</b>\r\n- Collection of different images for Lock and Home Screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Favorites</b>\r\n- Collecting background in one section which you like most in one section.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Categories:</b>\r\n- Providing Images sorted across 33+ categories which includes: <b>Black, 3D, Amoled, Nature, Anime, Girls etc.</b>\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nAll the images in this app are under common creative license and the credit goes to their respective owners. These images are not endorsed by any of the prospective owners, and the images are used simply for aesthetic purposes. No copyright infringement is intended, and any request to remove one of the images/logos/names will be honored.",
